      "content": "wow ok. that's a pretty strong take. aren't there some historians who would argue that the British were actually trying to balance both sides given the situation at the time? like, saying it was a complex diplomatic mess rather than just a single deliberate betrayal? i'm just trying to understand the different scholarly viewpoints for my paper.",
